{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嘿～这边的超市不仅很实惠，商品也很全呢……」", "text_idx": 152, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4665", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱凪住的那个地方，\\n　确实也不太会到这边来买东西呢」", "text_idx": 154, "plain": "「纱凪住的那个地方，　确实也不太会到这边来买东西呢」", "plain_idx": 155, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果我是一个人住的话可能还好」", "text_idx": 156, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4666", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但理央说要买自己想要的点心的话，\\n　就只能到附近的超市了呢……」", "text_idx": 158, "plain": "「但理央说要买自己想要的点心的话，　就只能到附近的超市了呢……」", "plain_idx": 159, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4667", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为是星期天，客人比平常多很多。", "text_idx": 161, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——能告诉我你家附近的超市在哪吗？", "text_idx": 162, "plain": "——能告诉我你家附近的超市在哪吗？", "plain_idx": 162, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天电话里她这样拜托了我，\\n于是今天我就接她来到了这里。", "text_idx": 163, "plain": "昨天电话里她这样拜托了我，于是今天我就接她来到了这里。", "plain_idx": 164, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说起来，打电话过去的是我来着。", "text_idx": 165, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……脑袋里突然浮现出了美羽学姐的身影，\\n我为了不把自责表露在脸上，偷偷甩了甩头。", "text_idx": 166, "plain": "……脑袋里突然浮现出了美羽学姐的身影，我为了不把自责表露在脸上，偷偷甩了甩头。", "plain_idx": 167, "len": 41, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但不知道是对谁的罪恶感依然残留着……", "text_idx": 168, "plain": "但不知道是对谁的罪恶感依然残留着……", "plain_idx": 168, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但昨晚打电话给纱凪时，\\n还有今天直接见到面时，我都确实很开心。", "text_idx": 169, "plain": "但昨晚打电话给纱凪时，还有今天直接见到面时，我都确实很开心。", "plain_idx": 170, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……这个点心，要不要买呢。\\n　确实是理央喜欢的来着」", "text_idx": 171, "plain": "「啊……这个点心，要不要买呢。　确实是理央喜欢的来着」", "plain_idx": 172, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4668", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「既然难得来一次，也顺带买些别的吧？\\n　东西我来拿就行了」", "text_idx": 174, "plain": "「既然难得来一次，也顺带买些别的吧？　东西我来拿就行了」", "plain_idx": 175, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……总感觉怪怪的呢」", "text_idx": 176, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4669", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 178, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和理央买东西的时候，\\n　一直都是我来拿东西的……」", "text_idx": 179, "plain": "「和理央买东西的时候，　一直都是我来拿东西的……」", "plain_idx": 180, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4670", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难道说，我们现在这样很有夫妇的感觉吗？」", "text_idx": 182, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4671", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我也在想同样的事」", "text_idx": 184, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "周围确实有很多带着小孩子的夫妇。", "text_idx": 185, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然直到刚才为止还没意识到这点。", "text_idx": 186, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只不过看到周围他们的样子时。", "text_idx": 187, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总会不自觉地羡慕他们。", "text_idx": 188, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对了，给上午组的人带一些过去吧」", "text_idx": 189, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4672", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说的也是。今天就这样穿着私服过去吧」", "text_idx": 191, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4673", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "刚说完，走在旁边的纱凪就停下了脚步。", "text_idx": 194, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了？」", "text_idx": 195, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、嗯。果然……\\n　我这种像男孩子的穿搭还是算了吧……」", "text_idx": 196, "plain": "「啊、嗯。果然……　我这种像男孩子的穿搭还是算了吧……」", "plain_idx": 197, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4674", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾你也是这么想的吧，\\n　和你一起走在身边的人还是女孩子的穿搭更好点吧？」", "text_idx": 199, "plain": "「新吾你也是这么想的吧，　和你一起走在身边的人还是女孩子的穿搭更好点吧？」", "plain_idx": 200, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4675", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我回头抓住了纱凪的手。", "text_idx": 202, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，等等……我话还没有……」", "text_idx": 203, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4676", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和你在一起的话，\\n　你无论穿什么我都喜欢哦」", "text_idx": 205, "plain": "「和你在一起的话，　你无论穿什么我都喜欢哦」", "plain_idx": 206, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「？！」", "text_idx": 207, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4677", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且你穿女孩子的服装的话，\\n　肯定会引起周围男性的注意吧」", "text_idx": 209, "plain": "「而且你穿女孩子的服装的话，　肯定会引起周围男性的注意吧」", "plain_idx": 210, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……那样的话，你会嫉妒吗？」", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4678", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嫉妒吗……」", "text_idx": 213, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说着我不禁笑了起来。", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不愧是“我的”纱凪」", "text_idx": 215, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "肯定会嫉妒的。", "text_idx": 216, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "无论什么时候，我都没有想过把她交给谁。", "text_idx": 217, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……抱歉。\\n　都怪我太在意多余的事情了……」", "text_idx": 218, "plain": "「……抱歉。　都怪我太在意多余的事情了……」", "plain_idx": 219, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4679", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和新吾交往的事情，\\n　到现在也还没和美羽学姐还有班上的大家说……」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": "「和新吾交往的事情，　到现在也还没和美羽学姐还有班上的大家说……」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4680", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用在意的」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是……」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4681", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「开始交往那时不就已经决定了吗」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想和你一起继续走下去。\\n　慢慢来也没事的，我们一起慢慢改变吧」", "text_idx": 228, "plain": "「我想和你一起继续走下去。　慢慢来也没事的，我们一起慢慢改变吧」", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4682", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以没必要那么着急的。\\n　时间也还有很多，而且……」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": "「所以没必要那么着急的。　时间也还有很多，而且……」", "plain_idx": 232, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我会一直在你身边的」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这之后也会像这样在纱凪你的旁边，\\n　拿着买好的东西」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": "「这之后也会像这样在纱凪你的旁边，　拿着买好的东西」", "plain_idx": 235, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「新吾……」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4683", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "说得我自己都有点害羞了。", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们就这样注视了一会彼此，\\n惹得路过的老夫妇笑了起来。", "text_idx": 239, "plain": "我们就这样注视了一会彼此，惹得路过的老夫妇笑了起来。", "plain_idx": 240, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到他们的反应，我们回过了神来。", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总、总感觉我们没考虑好说话的场所呢」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": "「总、总感觉我们没考虑好说话的场所呢」", "plain_idx": 242, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4684", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说的是呢。继续买东西吧」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯♪」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4685", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪回握住了我的手。", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大幅摇晃着手臂走了起来。", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "后来似乎又意识到会给别人添麻烦，稍微低调了点。", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与身处的环境和身上的服装无关。", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "只要和她在一起，我无论怎样都会像是这样笑出来。", "text_idx": 251, "plain": "只要和她在一起，我无论怎样都会像是这样笑出来。", "plain_idx": 251, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「东西分我一半来拿吧？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4686", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没事的，都是点心，轻得很」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才不是这种问题。\\n　只是感觉两人一起分一半，这样子很不错不是吗」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": "「才不是这种问题。　只是感觉两人一起分一半，这样子很不错不是吗」", "plain_idx": 256, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4687", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "纱凪一边笑着，一边从我这抢走了购物袋。", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「说起来，\\n　还没决定明天一起见面的地方呢」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "「说起来，　还没决定明天一起见面的地方呢」", "plain_idx": 260, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4688", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这么说来确实」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯嗯、那就……晚上七点在这个地方吧！」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4689", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在这吗？」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没错。这里离你家也近不是吗」", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4690", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但不是还有社团活动吗，不一起回去吗？」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这可不行。我可是还要做各种各样的准备的」", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4691", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真想问一下这个“各种各样”到底都是什么呢。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，明晚七点在这个地方见面……\\n　是这样没错吧？」", "text_idx": 272, "plain": "「那，明晚七点在这个地方见面……　是这样没错吧？」", "plain_idx": 273, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「让我多等1分钟我都直接回去哦」", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_sn4692", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「了解了解」", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "据至今为止的经验来看，\\n和纱凪约定见面的话都还是早点到预定地点比较好呢。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": "据至今为止的经验来看，和纱凪约定见面的话都还是早点到预定地点比较好呢。", "plain_idx": 278, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "毕竟，\\n纱凪她多半都会比预定时间要早得多到……", "text_idx": 279, "plain": "毕竟，纱凪她多半都会比预定时间要早得多到……", "plain_idx": 280, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然后，在这天的社团活动结束，回去的时候。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和昨天一样，我遇到了打工中的美羽学姐。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊、新吾，辛苦你了～」", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3340", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……学姐也辛苦了」", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一如平常的笑容。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是我笑不出来了。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐今天也是从上午开始就在活动室里工作着。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就算我和纱凪阻止，她也不会因此放弃。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那个」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼呼，现在天色已经很晚了，新吾你还是早点回去比较好哦？」", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3341", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 192, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——请不要再勉强自己了。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "——请不要再勉强自己了。", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我连这样的一句话都说不出来。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为我知道她会如何回应。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "没事的——她肯定会这样说吧，用她那一如平常的笑容。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么了？啊、新吾也要用纸巾吗～？」", "text_idx": 298, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3342", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我总感觉非常抱歉呢」", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3343", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你并没有做什么需要向我道歉的事哦？」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": "「你并没有做什么需要向我道歉的事哦？」", "plain_idx": 303, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3344", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是的。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "正是因为我什么都没做。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自从和纱凪交往后，我就一心沉迷于其中。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "总感觉和之前相比，我离学姐越来越远了。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我到底是为什么而加入这个社团的。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵，明明是休息日，社团活动辛苦你了。\\n　回去太晚会让小樱担心的哦？」", "text_idx": 310, "plain": "「呵呵，明明是休息日，社团活动辛苦你了。　回去太晚会让小樱担心的哦？」", "plain_idx": 311, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3345", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「学姐你也是……请不要太勉强自己了……」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好不容易才说出来的担心。", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "果然是那一如平常的笑容，然后。", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谢谢关心，但是我没事的哦♪」", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "_mu3346", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_sana_route06_09.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我再也说不出更多的话来了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
